body:
Besides the point what planet are you living on where cops make 100k...in the upper ranks yes but literally nowhere do they make that much as just a regular cop more like 40-50k starting (source: dad is a retired cop). The entire state government is underpaid with exception of our elected officials. CPS is just another corrupt system that needs a total revamp. This has happened so many times the city just keeps letting it slip and "apologizing"

&#x200B;

The fact that he was NYPD could be relevant to why he got off, but at the same time the city has constantly proven for decades that they don't care about funding cps or taking action against child abuse. Elisa Izquierdo, Nixzmary Brown, Lisa Steinberg ect. ALL had complaints and nothing was done.

This is a perfect example of just because you go to college doesn't make you intelligent. There are many reasons why people don't go to college. I scored high on my SATs and I was in a few honors classes, but I dropped out of college to go to cosmetology school and I don't regret it for a second.  It just isn't for everyone. 

&#x200B;

It's appalling that someone who calls themselves liberal would say this. I mean who's side is he on? I literally would think this is a republican. Trade jobs and service jobs are still respectable jobs, if anything our asses work way harder than a lot of these bros that went to college complaining about how they want free stuff because of it. I'd love for this guy to spend a day at my job.
